# The loading clerk in Lino's flat. Gate A of chapter one.
#
# The rule he states in REPLY_STRIKE is the puzzle, and it is stated in full
# before the player can use it: what is already recorded as delivered cannot be
# withdrawn, because that would be a second withdrawal of the same thing and a
# second withdrawal is not provided for. Everything else he says is texture.
#
# It is also the whole game in miniature, which is why it is the tutorial: Lino
# saves his papers with the same cavil that saves his life at midnight.
#
# Order-free by construction. The label can be found before or after the rule is
# heard — the option that uses it only asks for saw_delivery_label, and looking
# at the box raises that whatever else has happened. A tutorial that can be
# walked into backwards has to work backwards.

uid    baggadlgclrk01
colour 0.72 0.76 0.86

line start
    says DLG_CLERK_START

    option DLG_CLERK_OPT_WHO
        if    !asked_who
        raise asked_who
        reply DLG_CLERK_REPLY_WHO

    option DLG_CLERK_OPT_LIST
        if    !asked_list
        raise asked_list
        reply DLG_CLERK_REPLY_LIST

    option DLG_CLERK_OPT_MINE
        if    asked_list !asked_mine
        raise asked_mine
        reply DLG_CLERK_REPLY_MINE

    # The rule. Available from the start and repeatable, because it is the one
    # thing the player may need to hear twice — and an option that vanishes
    # after being taken once is how a tutorial becomes unsolvable.
    option DLG_CLERK_OPT_STRIKE
        if    !box_struck_off
        reply DLG_CLERK_REPLY_STRIKE

    option DLG_CLERK_OPT_LABEL
        if   saw_delivery_label !box_struck_off
        goto label

    option DLG_CLERK_OPT_THANKS
        if    box_struck_off !thanked
        raise thanked
        reply DLG_CLERK_REPLY_THANKS

    option DLG_CLERK_OPT_BYE
        reply DLG_CLERK_REPLY_BYE
        end

# He goes over and reads it. Two beats and not one: the pen coming out is the
# payoff the player worked for, and a payoff delivered inside the same sentence
# as the request reads as nothing having happened.
line label
    says DLG_CLERK_LABEL

    option DLG_CLERK_OPT_LABEL_YES
        raise box_struck_off
        reply DLG_CLERK_REPLY_LABEL_YES
        end

    option DLG_CLERK_OPT_LABEL_NO
        goto start
